<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Fast Roll Traveling / Light Armor</Major>
    <Description>With this macro you can fast roll travel through the map.
It will continuously roll in perfect time (2 times), so your stamina is recharging fast again.
You have to have light armor roll equipped, that's important.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 26 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyDown 225 1
KeyUp 225 1
Delay 280 ms
KeyDown 225 1
KeyUp 225 1
Delay 3400 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>New World</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>